@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@
+# JeRyu Web Forge
+
+JeRyu Web Forge is the Rust/Axum + Vite/TypeScript/React browser experience for the full GitHub/GitLab-class JeRyu product.
+
+## Local development
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run web:dev
+cargo run -p jeryu -- web serve --dev-proxy
+```
+
+## Production build
+
+```bash
+npm run web:build
+cargo run -p jeryu -- web serve --static-dir apps/web/dist
+```
+
+## Proof lanes
+
+```bash
+npm run ux-qa
+npm run web:test
+npm run web:e2e
+cargo check -p jeryu --message-format=json
+cargo nextest run -p jeryu --lib
+```
+
+## Core UX surfaces
+
+- All repositories dashboard.
+- Repository creation/import.
+- Repo home with safe README rendering.
+- Code tree/blob/history/blame browser.
+- Merge room with exact-SHA approvals, checks, threads, conflicts, and policy gates.
+- Issues, projects, CI/CD, runners, agents, evidence, notifications, and audit.
+- Global/repo/user settings cockpit.
+- Real-time activity rail over `/api/ws`.
